                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "this is no longer a VR only game and can be played by anyone but you will need a controller. that said outside the novelty of the game it's a bit boring and the controller, alien, robot things voice gets a little annoying as he is the tutorial/narrator so is almost always talking.\n\nyou play as 4 roller girls that you swap between on the fly. each with a different weapon (think elements) and enemies will only take damage from 1 or 2 of the girls. you need to touch as many cows as you can before they get abducted or killed. most levels are side scrolling to the right though you can go into the background a bit. there are hidden secrets but i'm not sure what they give. they also have bike levels where your moving forward down a road but you only use 1 girl on these and you can not attack. you can unlock and reply levels you beat but i don't think there is a cow counter or anything to better if you do replay one. \n\nunless you want a relaxing cheap vr game there isn't much reason to get this. it looks cute but none vr has slowdown for me when ever i use the green girl so ofc most enemies are week to her and she has the worst weapon. i also got stuck on level 10 twice but the 2nd time when i reset the level it took me to the next one (i think the 2nd time i was next to the exit when i got stuck). there are a few \"coming soon\" in the menu. i have a feeling they are not going to be coming at all as this is from 2016. this has some charm but i don't see most people getting into it.",
